{"title":"Wednesday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/924633947/0/marginalrevolution~Wednesday-assorted-links.html","date":1757520488000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/08/28/arts/design/flora-yukhnovich-four-seasons-frick.html\" target=\"_blank\">Flora Yuknovich, painter</a> (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/AlvaroVargasLl/status/1964863717058986185\" target=\"_blank\">Further comments on Milei and Argentina</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/ZixuanMaWrites/status/1962297509684105484\" target=\"_blank\">My TA Zixuan Ma is starting a blog on China and also recommends these six books</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://suncoastsearchlight.org/new-college-florida-privatization-nathan-allen-desantis/?utm_source=Iterable&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=campaign_14887569_nl_Daily-Briefing_date_20250909\" target=\"_blank\">How is New College of Florida doing?</a></p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/basilhalperin/status/1965409656039449086?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">Some new Substacks from economics graduate students</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/jesusferna7026/status/1965393226556486120?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">Machine learning for economists</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/JesusFerna7026/status/1965747635207213276\" target=\"_blank\">double descent and econometrics</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/business/digital/ai-podcast-start-up-plan-shows-1236361367/\" target=\"